## App-name: rfid
> Handles biometric devices and attendances using rfid cards.


* Endpoints
    - Device
        - /getrequest - `polling, fetch enqued commands`
        - /ping - `health`
        - /cdata - `Incoming Logs Management (Attendance, setups)`
        - /devicecmd - `sends response for device commands`
    - Admin Panel
        - /devices - `devices management [add,update, delete]`
        - /users - `attd users management and sync`
        - /logs - `attd logs management`

* Models
- app:rfid
    - Device - `Devices per school`
    - DeviceCommand - `Commands in queue, fetched and executed by device`
    - RFIDAttdUser - `User linked to device and app:main.profiles`
    - RFIDAttdLog - `Attendance Logs`
- app:main.profiles `Relation`
    - Student [profile]
    - Staff [profile]

